# Static ad creation

Stage 1 uses one hook on every image. Finished ads go in `img/local-ads/`. Ad #1 is `img/local-ads/stage1-ad1-family-burden.png`. View them at http://127.0.0.1:8772/ (`python3 scripts/local-ad-viewer.py`).

Hook, three lines, unchanged on each new ad:

```
NO DEJE
A SU FAMILIA
CON LA CARGA.
```

- 4:5, 1080 × 1350. Lots of open space. One idea.
- The hook is the only large type. Bold, dark charcoal, centered in the upper and middle area, big enough to pass the squint test.
- Small Mejor Vida logo at the bottom left. A larger green chat bubble at the bottom right, with the word WhatsApp in white inside it and no phone icon. That bubble is the only CTA.
- No button, CTA phrase, price, phone number, or extra body text on the image.
- Extra explanation stays in the Facebook main text, off the image.
- Stage 1 still pairs many images with this one hook. Change the picture. Do not change the hook.
